spec VisitorSnapshot.tla
check INVARIANTS NoSecretPublished FailureKeepsPrevious PublishedCountsAreValidated
reach PublishedCounts | Success
reach FailedFetch | Failed
run Success | HasCredentials=TRUE FetchOk=TRUE
run Failed | HasCredentials=TRUE FetchOk=FALSE
run Unconfigured | HasCredentials=FALSE FetchOk=TRUE
